(89317, 137320, 240696, 'enUS', 'Oh, $n it\'s good to see you again! The children have been asking about you non-stop since last year. It sounds like they would like to go on an adventure with you again.\n\nAre you here to take them for the week?', 0, 60568); -- Children's Week in Dornogal
